# DESK19 side-effect: *Default dir* becomes OBSERVABLE (DESK18 could not show
# it). The same two-window drag as d19-defdir-app, but with *Default dir* set
# to `Window` in Options -> Desktop configuration first, so `do_aopen` takes
# `win_ontop()`'s directory (the SOURCE window) instead of the destination
# window's. Expected cwd C:\DESKT19.
#   ADDESKCF: DCDEFWIN (432,129), DCOK (256,401)                      [probe 2]
